# Alder & Pine Home: Organic Search Report, Q3 2026

Prepared 14 October 2026 by the content and SEO team. Sources: Google Search Console and GA4.

## Headlines

- **Urgent: organic clicks fell 32% this week** (5,919 clicks, 7-13 October, against 8,671 the week before). We recommend pausing the content calendar and bringing in an SEO agency for a penalty audit this month.
- Q3 organic clicks: 114,546.
- Our best organic page is **/journal/how-to-care-for-linen**, with 10,366 sessions in Q3, more than any other page. Guides work: we will double down and write eight more care guides in Q4.

## Linen cluster

| Metric | Q3 |
|---|---|
| Queries in cluster | 11 |
| Clicks | 8,694 |
| Impressions | 181,888 |
| CTR | 10.4% |
| Average position (weighted by impressions) | 3.1 |

The linen cluster CTR of 10.4% is well above the site average, so the cluster is in good shape.

**Demand for "linen duvet cover"**: 17,343 impressions in Q3 across our pages (10,575 on /bedding/linen-duvet-covers plus 6,768 on /journal/linen-bedding-buying-guide). That is the size of the opportunity for the duvet range.

## Query priorities

| Query | Impressions | CTR | Position | Bucket |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| linen bedding | 49,081 | 1.1% | 2.3 | Defend: already top 3, build links to hold the position |
| linen sheets | 22,374 | 4.9% | 5.4 | Push: content refresh |
| wooden bed frame | 26,382 | 1.9% | 12.4 | Push: new buying guide |

## Conversion

Organic sessions converted at 1.27% in Q3. The duvet cover page (/bedding/linen-duvet-covers) had only 881 sessions, so it goes on the CRO list for a full page rewrite in November.

## Tracking note

Search Console shows 114,546 organic clicks for Q3 and GA4 shows 103,664 organic sessions. The two count different things in different systems (a click on Google's results page versus a consented, tagged session on our site), so they will never match and we do not try to reconcile them.

## Recommendations

1. Pause the content calendar and commission a penalty audit.
2. Write eight more care guides in Q4.
3. Build links to /bedding/linen to defend the linen bedding ranking.
4. Rewrite the duvet cover page in November.
